  "stem": "The points $A(3, 1, 2)$, $B(1, 2, 0)$ and $C(1, 4, 1)$ are given. Show that triangle $ABC$ has a right angle at $B$, and that its area is $\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{5}}{2}$.",
